Output demos/09-correlation-matrix.gif
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1500
Set Height 800
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
# DO NOT DELETE - HEADER ABOVE

Hide
# Daily Bitcoin chain statistics since the genesis block: blocks, addresses, transactions, fees.
Type "datui demo/data/bitcoin_daily.parquet"
Enter
Sleep 0.8s
Show
Sleep 1s

# Open analysis.
Type "a"
Sleep 1.5s

# Down to Correlation Matrix.
Down
Sleep 0.5s
Down
Sleep 0.5s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s

# Scroll across the matrix.
Right
Sleep 0.5s
Right
Sleep 0.5s
Right
Sleep 0.5s
Right
Sleep 0.5s

Left
Sleep 0.5s
Left
Sleep 0.5s
Left
Sleep 0.5s
Left
Sleep 0.5s

Sleep 3s

Escape
Sleep 2s
Type "q"
